{"sourceUrl":"https://sky.tiangong.edu.cn/2026/0703/c5121a116265/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:11.325439+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sky.tiangong.edu.cn/2026/0703/c5121a116265/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span>为增进优秀大学生对天津工业大学生命科学学院的了解，提升同学们的科研兴趣，激发科研热情，加深同学之间以及师生之间的互动交流，选拔有潜质的优秀大学生到我院深造，生命科学学院将于</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span><span><span>日举办</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>级研究生招生夏令营活动。欢迎有意报考我院</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>级研究生的同学积极申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span>一、招生目录</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>院系所</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业</span></p></td><td><p><span>研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span>学习方式</span></p></td><td><p><span>学制（年）</span></p></td><td><p><span>考试科目</span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"6\"><p><span>生命科学学院</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>083100</span></span><span>生物医学工程</span></p><p><span>（学术学位）</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>01</span></span><span>医学电子诊疗技术</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>(1)</span></span><span>全日制</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span> ①</span><span><span>101</span></span><span>思想政治理论②</span><span><span>201</span></span><span>英语（一）③</span><span><span>301</span></span><span>数学（一）④</span><span><span>812</span></span><span>信号与系统</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>02</span></span><span><span><span><span>智能</span></span><span>医学</span><span><span>影像与数据</span></span><span>处理技术</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>(1)</span></span><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>03</span></span><span><span><span>脑科学与脑认知</span><span><span>技术</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>(1)</span></span><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>085400</span></span><span>电子信息</span></p><p><span>（专业学位）</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>01</span></span><span><span><span>医学电子诊疗技术</span><span><span>及应用</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>(1)</span></span><span>全日制</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span> ①</span><span><span>101</span></span><span>思想政治理论②</span><span><span>204</span></span><span>英语（二）③</span><span><span>302</span></span><span>数学（二）④</span><span><span>812</span></span><span>信号与系统</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>02</span></span><span><span><span><span>智能</span></span><span>医学</span><span><span>影像数据处理</span></span><span>技术</span><span><span>及应用</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>03 </span></span><span><span><span>脑科学与脑认知技术</span><span><span>及应用</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>二、申请资格</span></span></p><p><span><span>基本条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span><span><span>全日制</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>届应届本科生。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span><span><span>对从事学科学术研究有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新力和潜能。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span><span><span>专业排名在前</span></span><span><span><span>50%</span></span></span><span><span>，英语成绩优良，通过大学英语四、六级者优先。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sky.tiangong.edu.cn/2026/0703/c5121a116265/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>如报名人数较多，将进行筛选，参考内容包括：参与学科竞赛情况，英语水平，发表科研成果等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>对于某些方面非常优秀的申请人，如不满足基本条件，可凭两封相关领域教授推荐信进行报名，参与筛选，如通过筛选，可以入营参与活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>日前填写申请表发送至</span></span><span><span><span>sky_summercamp@126.com</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>前</span></span></span><span><span>收到确认邮件后即为报名成功。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>四、活动安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>开营时间为</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span><span><span>日，原则上活动时间为一天，计划接待</span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span>人左右。如遇特殊情况，活动需改期，则另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>学术交流、专家讲座；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>优秀校友读研感悟分享、联谊座谈；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>学院科研情况介绍；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>对营员进行适当形式的考核（依照我校相关工作流程）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>考核合格，发放合格证。</span></span></p><p><span><span>考核内容包括：专业知识考核（电子技术基础、信号与系统），综合能力面试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、优惠政策</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>合格营员如获得所在学校的研究生推荐免试资格，并按学校规定时间内通过教育部</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（网址</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm)</span></span></span><span><span>，完成所有规定流程后，可直接拟录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span><span><span>合格营员报考我校</span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span>27</span></span></span></span><span><span>级硕士研究生，考试成绩达到我校的相应学科门类复试基本分数线（即学校线，含总分、单科分数）后，可直接参加复试，不受学院分数线限制，表现优异者可优先拟录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>六、其他</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次活动为线上活动，入营人员需按时参加各项活动，严格遵守考核纪律，不得作弊，一旦发现，取消夏令营资格。</span></span></p><p><span>  </span></p><p><span><span>天津工业大学</span></span></p><p><span><span>生命科学学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二〇二</span></span><span><span><span>六</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>七</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>三</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f87431cd0c3489a3ea08b9ccbb70367364798ad1842e86c69c3436eee4e24daf","textLength":1104,"sourceSha256":"6512feef9d1878bc27a87aaf5e52db12aac42abb19edfad42e3b37b67990b2d2","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3eca15cbb8d48a24610f","title":"2026年天津工业大学生命科学学院2027级研究生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:11.325439+00:00"}
